  "details": "I've noticed the controller models now appear in the Camera or Stream Cam now, making photos and videos a lot harder. Based on past cannys, this could've been a thing already, but the new issue in the beta is that pointing your hands at the camera to grab it now makes the controller models appear.\n\nI'm using Index controllers.\n\nProbably related to:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1480-disable-controller-models\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/the-index-controller-guide-models-appears-in-the-camera-and-mirrors",
